# 8. Data Relationships

The database shall maintain the following relationships:

```text
Customers
    │
    │ Customer_ID
    ▼
Orders
    │
    ├──────── Product_ID ────────► Products
    │
    └──────── Order_ID ──────────► Payments
```

## 8.1 Customer → Orders

One customer may have multiple orders.

```text
Customers.Customer_ID
        ↓
Orders.Customer_ID
```

Relationship:

**1 : Many**

---

## 8.2 Products → Orders

One product may occur in multiple orders.

```text
Products.Product_ID
        ↓
Orders.Product_ID
```

Relationship:

**1 : Many**

---

## 8.3 Orders → Payments

An order is associated with payment information.

```text
Orders.Order_ID
        ↓
Payments.Order_ID
```

Relationship:

**1 : 1 / 1 : Many depending on future payment extensions**

The implementation should not assume that only one payment record can ever exist if the system is later extended to support retries or multiple payment attempts.

