# 32. Multi-Step Investigation

The agent shall support multiple analytical calls for complex questions.

Example:

```text
User:
Why did profit fall?

        ↓

Sales comparison

        ↓

Category analysis

        ↓

Product analysis

        ↓

Discount analysis

        ↓

Refund analysis

